Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.20,0:00:05.90,Title,,0,0,0,,TALWANDI | 1469
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:06.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Rai Bhoi di Talwandi, Punjab.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:11.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tripta and Mehta Kalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:19.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Their child was named Nanak.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.00,0:00:33.00,Info,,0,0,0,,JANAMSAKHI TRADITION | NOT EYEWITNESS EVIDENCE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.00,0:00:39.00,Info,,0,0,0,,NEXT MORNING | JANAMSAKHI TRADITION
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Later texts mention a midwife, Daulatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:33.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,And an astrologer named Hardial.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:39.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Later tradition, not eyewitness history.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:45.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Today: Nankana Sahib, Pakistan.
